          "contentValue": "cellf the basic unit of all living organisms, it is surroundea by cell surface membrane and contains genetic material ODNAJ and cytoplasm containing organelles organellet functionally and structurally distinct part of cell, 9 ribosome or mitochondrion nucleus Iplural nucleih relatively large organelle found in eukaryotic cells, but absent from  prokaryotic cells, the nucleus contains the cells DNA and therefore controls the activities of the cell, it is surrounded by two membranes which together form the nuclear envelope",
