          "contentValue": "Organisms made of cells with membrane-bound nuclei are now known as eukaryotes, while the simpler cells lacking membrane-bound nucle are known a5 prokaryotes eu means true karyon means nucleus pro  means before  Eukaryotes are thought to have evolved from prokaryotes more than two billion years agO  Prokaryotes include bacteria Eukaryotes include animals plants fungl and some other organisms",
