          "contentValue": "Fhe study Of cells has glven Fise t0 an mportant brancl of biology known as cell biology Cell biologists study cells using many different methods including the use various types of microscope There are two fundamentally different types of mcroscope the light microscope and the electron microscope Both use form of radiation in order t0 see the specimen being examined The light microscop uses light as source of radiation  while the electron microscope uses electrons for reasons which are discussed later",
